{% comment %}
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Section: Aura Feature Grid (FR)
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  @description
    A bordered card with a 2-column icon feature grid (Hollow-style strip under
    the buy box). Each feature = icon + short label. Styles in
    assets/aura-v2.css (.feature-grid).
  @blocks
    - feature : icon + label
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
{% endcomment %}

